              <div class="report-heading">2D ECHOCARDIOGRAPHY & COLOR DOPPLER</div>
              <div class="report-body-text">QUANTITATIVE MEASUREMENTS:
• LVIDd: 4.4 cm | LVIDs: 2.8 cm | IVSd: 0.9 cm | LVPWd: 0.9 cm
• LV Ejection Fraction: 62 % | Left Atrium: 3.2 cm | Aortic Root: 2.9 cm

FINDINGS:
• LEFT VENTRICLE: Normal internal dimensions. Preserved global LV systolic function. No regional wall motion abnormality (RWMA) at rest.
• VALVES: Mitral and aortic valves show normal leaflet mobility and thickness. No MR/AR/MS/AS.
• TRICUSPID & PULMONARY: Structurally normal. Normal pulmonary artery pressures.
• PERICARDIUM: Clear with no fluid separation.</div>

